- Ran: `go test ./cmd/entire/cli/transcript -run TestCompact` (passes)
- Ran: `go test ./cmd/entire/cli/transcript -run TestParseFromBytes_NormalizesRoleToType` (passes)

PR reviewed: [entireio/cli#754](https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/754).

